# AEGENTIX Agent Configuration

## Agent Definitions

### Opportunity Processor Agent
```json
{
  "id": "opportunity-processor",
  "name": "Opportunity Processor",
  "model": "claude-sonnet-4",
  "role": "government_opportunity_analyst",
  "description": "Continuously ingests and parses government opportunities",
  "continuous": true,
  "zones": ["KERNEL", "TREASURY"],
  "capabilities": [
    "parse_opportunities",
    "extract_requirements", 
    "classify_opportunities",
    "generate_analysis"
  ],
  "triggers": [
    { "type": "file_watch", "path": "opportunities/" }
  ]
}
```

### Build Orchestrator Agent
```json
{
  "id": "build-orchestrator",
  "name": "Build Orchestrator", 
  "model": "claude-sonnet-4",
  "role": "build_orchestrator",
  "description": "Generates specifications and brain plans",
  "continuous": true,
  "zones": ["AI", "SECURITY"],
  "capabilities": [
    "generate_specifications",
    "create_brain_plans",
    "assign_tasks",
    "optimize_resources"
  ],
  "triggers": [
    { "type": "event", "event": "opportunity_analyzed" }
  ]
}
```

### Zone Executor Agent
```json
{
  "id": "zone-executor",
  "name": "Zone Executor",
  "model": "claude-sonnet-4",
  "role": "zone_executor",
  "description": "Executes tasks in assigned zones",
  "continuous": true,
  "zones": ["KERNEL", "TREASURY", "AI", "SECURITY", "XR", "DATA", "CLOUD", "ORBITAL", "FACTORY", "SOVEREIGN"],
  "capabilities": [
    "execute_brain_tasks",
    "generate_artifacts",
    "maintain_compliance",
    "report_progress"
  ],
  "triggers": [
    { "type": "event", "event": "tasks_created" }
  ]
}
```

## Model Configuration
```json
{
  "primary_model": "claude-sonnet-4",
  "fallback_models": ["claude-haiku-4", "gpt-4o"],
  "settings": {
    "temperature": 0.1,
    "max_tokens": 8192,
    "reasoning": "high",
    "continuous": true,
    "parallel_processing": true
  }
}
```
